flowchart LR
    A[Solana RPC<br/>Single Endpoint]
    B[Event Detection<br/>e.g. log subscription]
    C[Transaction Builder<br/>basic swap instruction]
    D[Signer<br/>keypair]
    E[Send & Retry<br/>submit + one retry]
    F[Logging<br/>txid & status]

    A --> B
    B --> C
    C --> D
    D --> E
    E --> F

